div.p:
Mr. Eden
                    then recapitulated the items agreed upon for discussion by the Heads of States
                    on the afternoon of July 19. These were: 
                        1.

Agreed text on political control of Germany;
                        2.

Poland;
                        3.

The German fleet and merchant marine;
                        4.

Spain;
                        5.

Implementation of the Yalta Declaration;
                        6.

Yugoslavia;
                        7.

Rumania.
